OL,3,AWoman, 21, dies in crash following
OL,4,Apolice pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaffordshire Police and West Midlands
OL,7,FPolice are under investigation after a
OL,8,F21-year-old woman died in a crash
OL,9,Ffollowing a police pursuit in
OL,10,FStaffordshire.
OL,12,FThe woman, who was a front-seat
OL,13,Fpassenger in a Seat Ibiza being
OL,14,Ffollowed by officers, died at the scene
OL,15,Fof the collision on Rugeley Road in
OL,16,FHednesford shortly after 23:00 GMT on
OL,17,FFriday, Staffordshire Police said.
OL,19,FThe force said the Seat collided with a
OL,20,FVauxhall Astra being driven by a member
OL,21,Fof the public.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
